sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Browser as 浏览器<br/>asr_realtime.js
    participant Server as voice-server<br/>live_asr_api.rs + FunasrClient
    participant FunASR as FunASR 服务<br/>funasr_wss_server.py

    Note over Browser,Server: 连接 #1：浏览器 ↔ voice-server（msgpack over WS）
    Note over Server,FunASR: 连接 #2：voice-server ↔ FunASR（JSON 文本帧 + 裸 PCM binary 帧 over WS）

    rect rgba(120,180,250,0.15)
    Note over Server,FunASR: 🔑 握手：Sec-WebSocket-Protocol: binary（funasr_wss_server.py:841 强制）
    Server->>FunASR: HTTP Upgrade<br/>Sec-WebSocket-Protocol: binary
    FunASR-->>Server: 101 Switching Protocols
    end

    Browser->>Server: msgpack {type: "session_start", sample_rate, channels, ...}
    Note over Server: 派生 per-session FunasrConfig<br/>(sample_rate/channels 来自前端)

    Server->>FunASR: Text JSON 首次帧<br/>{mode:"2pass", wav_name:"live-asr-web-xxx",<br/>is_speaking:true, wav_format:"pcm", audio_fs:16000,<br/>chunk_size:[5,10,5], itn:true}
    Note over Server: last_online_text := ""

    Server-->>Browser: msgpack SessionAck {success:true}

    rect rgba(120,250,160,0.15)
    Note over Browser,FunASR: 🔁 音频流（每 ~100ms）
    Browser->>Server: msgpack AudioChunk {data: PCM s16le}
    Server->>FunASR: Binary 帧（裸 PCM，无 wrapper）
    end

    rect rgba(250,220,120,0.18)
    Note over Server,FunASR: ⚠️ FunASR 服务端推的是**累积全文**（不是 delta）
    Note over Server: 服务端在 live_asr_api 做<br/>累积 → delta 转换（last_online_text cache）
    end

    FunASR-->>Server: Text JSON {mode:"2pass-online", text:"今", is_final:false}
    Note over Server: delta = "今"[0..] = "今"
    Server-->>Browser: msgpack AsrPartial {text:"今", is_final:false, replace_last:false}
    Note over Browser: partialBuffer += "今"<br/>DOM 追加渲染 → 显示 "… 今"

    FunASR-->>Server: {mode:"2pass-online", text:"今天", is_final:false}
    Note over Server: delta = "今天"[0..] = "天"
    Server-->>Browser: AsrPartial {text:"天", is_final:false, replace_last:false}
    Note over Browser: 显示 "… 今天"

    FunASR-->>Server: {mode:"2pass-online", text:"今天天气", is_final:false}
    Server-->>Browser: AsrPartial {text:"天气", is_final:false, replace_last:false}
    Note over Browser: 显示 "… 今天天气"

    FunASR-->>Server: {mode:"2pass-online", text:"今天天气很好", is_final:true}
    Note over Server: 句终：last_online_text.clear()
    Server-->>Browser: AsrPartial {text:"很好", is_final:true, replace_last:false}
    Note over Browser: 整段上屏为 final 行 ✓<br/>partialBuffer := ""

    FunASR-->>Server: {mode:"2pass-offline", text:"今天天气很好。", is_final:true}
    Note over Server: 纠错模式：replace_last = true
    Server-->>Browser: AsrPartial {text:"今天天气很好。", is_final:true, replace_last:true}
    Note over Browser: 替换最近一条 final 行<br/>(✓ 今天天气很好 → ✓ 今天天气很好。)

    rect rgba(250,150,150,0.12)
    Note over Browser,FunASR: 🛑 会话结束
    end

    Browser->>Server: msgpack SessionEnd
    Server->>FunASR: Text JSON {is_speaking:false}
    FunASR-->>Server: Close 帧（FunASR 无 task-finished）
    Note over Server: recv_event 返回 Ok(None)
    Server-->>Browser: (关闭，sessions.remove)

    Note over Browser,FunASR: 两条 WS 各自独立结束<br/>浏览器↔server 走正常 msgpack 关闭<br/>server↔FunASR 靠服务端 Close 帧识别会话结束